ever clarified to be otherwise, this directory must be revisited before any
distribution.

Modifications made for zkagent M0 (see README.md for the full list and reasons):
  - removed the Google product flavour, Firebase analytics/crashlytics and
    Play Ads/Review, and upstream's google-services.json
  - removed upstream's PRIVACY.md (a Play-listing policy for upstream's app)
  - removed the DG2 (facial image) read and the jnbis dependency
  - pinned compileSdk/targetSdk to 36
  - added M0Probe.kt (timings, ok/allowed verdicts, AA/CA probes, derivation
    candidates, planted negative tests) and stage logging in the read path

The package name and namespace remain upstream's (com.tananaev.passportreader)
and MUST be changed before this code is distributed in any form. This is a
throwaway spike and is not intended for distribution.

This product includes software developed by third parties:
  JMRTD (LGPL), SCUBA (LGPL), SpongyCastle/BouncyCastle (MIT-style),
  Apache Commons IO (Apache-2.0), Material Components (Apache-2.0).
These are resolved from Maven and are not vendored here.
